OL,4,BCummins' Australia captaincy at a      
OL,5,Bcrossroads - Agnew                     
OL,6,GAustralia captain Pat Cummins, much    
OL,7,Glike his fellow bowlers, is in the eye 
OL,8,Gof the sandpapergate storm at the      
OL,9,Gmoment.                                
