OL,12,Fnotion that Cameron Bancroft - the     
OL,13,Fmost inexperienced batsman in the      
OL,14,FAustralia team at the time ` would use 
OL,15,Fsandpaper on the ball against South    
OL,16,FAfrica without the bowlers knowing has 
OL,17,Fnever made sense.                      
